    <h2>What Is Refine Report?</h2>
    <p>Refine Report is a one-click feature inside SARVARC Workspace's main canvas that turns your content into a fully formatted, brand-consistent document. Instead of manually building a layout, choosing fonts, placing a logo, or matching colors by hand, you generate a report that already carries your brand identity: your logo, your accent colors, a proper header and footer, and consistent section styling throughout.</p>
    <p>The feature reads your brand's visual identity, extracts the relevant colors and logo placement, and applies that styling across the entire document automatically. What used to be a design task becomes a single action.</p>

    <div class="section-divider"><span class="diamond"></span></div>
    <h2>Why Formatting Is the Part Nobody Has Time For</h2>
    <p>Formatting a document properly is not hard. It is just slow, repetitive, and easy to get wrong under a deadline. A report that looks inconsistent, with mismatched fonts, an off-brand color, or a missing logo, quietly signals something to a client: that this was rushed, or that the business behind it does not pay attention to detail.</p>
    <p class="pull-quote">Clients rarely comment on good formatting. They notice bad formatting immediately.</p>
    <p>A polished, consistent document builds a small but real form of trust before a single word of content is read. That trust compounds over every report you send. Refine Report exists so that trust is built by default, not by extra hours of manual design work before every deadline.</p>

