    <div class="faq-list">
    <div class="faq-item">
      <h3>What is Refine Report in SARVARC Workspace?</h3>
      <p>Refine Report is a feature inside SARVARC Workspace's main canvas that automatically generates a fully branded report, complete with your logo, brand colors, header, and footer, from content already inside your workspace.</p>
