    <div class="faq-item">
      <h3>Can Refine Report use data from a form or spreadsheet?</h3>
      <p>Yes. Data structured in Data Arrangement and responses collected through SARVARC Forms can be pushed directly into a report generated with Refine Report, without exporting or re-uploading files.</p>
