    <div class="faq-item">
      <h3>Does Refine Report replace the need for a template in Word or Canva?</h3>
      <p>For most client-facing reports, yes. Refine Report generates the branded layout directly from your content and brand assets, removing the need to maintain a separate template in another tool.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h3>Is Refine Report only for large reports?</h3>
      <p>No. It works for short client updates and longer, multi-section reports alike. The branding and layout logic scales to the content you bring into the canvas.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
